+## Trusted terminal recovery (LT-180)
+
+See `remedy-terminal-recovery.md` for the exact `cxone-terminal-v1` contract,
+separate non-secret `REMEDY_REVIEWER_TRUST_EPOCH` prerequisite, explicit support
+action, fresh-scan/proof revalidation and immutable preparation/CAS workflow.
+Known terminal success/no-write proof needs no redundant offline ceremony; unknown
+outcomes retain only their existing offline-resolution path. Lookup never clears
+a claim or retries a write, historical recovery needs no signer, and original
+audit/history/conformance separation and LibreTexts' write/rollout gate remain.
